sequenceDiagram
  title Card authorization, as drawn
  autonumber
  actor merchant as Merchant
  participant auth as Authorization switch
  participant fraud as Fraud scoring
  participant ledger as Card ledger
  merchant->>auth: Presents a transaction
  activate auth
  auth->>fraud: Score the transaction
  fraud-->>auth: Score
  alt approved
    auth->>ledger: Post the authorization
    auth-)ledger: Authorization event
  else declined
    auth-->>merchant: Decline
  end
  deactivate auth
  Note over auth: under 500ms end to end
  Note over fraud: The screening call has a circuit breaker, not a retry.
